@startuml
title P3 Capture quality and diagnostics - task seams

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User

package "Story tasks" {
  rectangle "TASK-260712-1gmsvh\nFreeze contract" as Contract
  rectangle "TASK-260712-265o0f\nWindows voice-processing probe" as WinProbe
  rectangle "TASK-260712-2gaswa\nmacOS voice-processing probe" as MacProbe
  rectangle "TASK-260712-wcdz08\nWindows live capture effects" as WinImpl
  rectangle "TASK-260712-2egweh\nmacOS live capture effects" as MacImpl
  rectangle "TASK-260712-1pw1l1\nDiagnostics + capability surface" as Surface
  rectangle "TASK-260712-39czd2\nRegression harness" as Harness
  rectangle "TASK-260712-2e80pr\nC3 evidence + capability pack" as Evidence
}

package "External story dependencies" {
  rectangle "STORY-260712-30ju1k\nP1 Windows packaged-app spike" as WinSpike
  rectangle "STORY-260712-2e36uz\nP1 main UI + capture foundation" as CaptureP1
  rectangle "STORY-260712-fes2jj\nP1 overlay + local ceiling mixer" as MixerP1
  rectangle "STORY-260712-sskhip\nP3 live PTT transport" as LivePTT
  rectangle "STORY-260712-2ft5wd\nP3 acceptance + rollout gate" as Acceptance
}

User --> Contract
User --> Evidence

WinSpike --> WinProbe : signed AppContainer proof
Contract --> WinImpl : shared states + failure policy
Contract --> MacImpl : shared states + failure policy
Contract --> Surface : protocol + UI vocabulary

WinProbe --> WinImpl : selected bridge
MacProbe --> MacImpl : selected stack

CaptureP1 --> WinImpl : capture service + picker + indicator
CaptureP1 --> MacImpl : capture service + picker + indicator
MixerP1 --> WinImpl : ducking + ceiling ordering
MixerP1 --> MacImpl : ducking + ceiling ordering
LivePTT --> WinImpl : streaming session + chunk flow
LivePTT --> MacImpl : streaming session + chunk flow
LivePTT --> Harness : packet-loss + latency interactions

WinImpl --> Surface
MacImpl --> Surface
Surface --> Harness
Harness --> Evidence
Evidence --> Acceptance

note bottom of Surface
Shared states must stay honest across both platforms:
- mode: auto, speaker, headphone
- effect state: enabled, degraded, unsupported
- health: quiet, clipping, no-device, permission
- ceiling preserved after AGC
end note

note bottom of Evidence
Final pack must separate:
- accepted combinations
- degraded but usable combinations
- unsupported combinations
- exact product and rollout wording
end note

@enduml
